---
---
<section class="s wrap rule fs" id="review" data-name="Review" aria-labelledby="rv-h">
  <div class="feat">
    <div class="copy">
      <h2 id="rv-h">Read the whole change. <span class="soft">Then decide.</span></h2>
      <p>Open any PR next to its list. You see the whole branch against its base, tick files off as you go, and when the agent pushes again, you see only what changed since you last looked.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Tick a file as reviewed with <kbd>V</kbd></li>
        <li>Only what's new since your last look with <kbd>D</kbd></li>
        <li>Approve <kbd>A</kbd>, request changes <kbd>C</kbd>, merge <kbd>M</kbd></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="app lit-shot" role="img" aria-label="Reviewing PR #121: two of three files ticked, the diff since your last look, and Request changes, Approve and Merge">
      <div class="app-top"><span class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>#121 · Show reviewers on PRs <span style="margin-left:auto" class="small">agent/web-307 → main</span></div>
      <div class="review-split">
        <div class="review-files">
          <p class="grp-h">3 files · 1 changed since you looked</p>
          <div class="row"><span class="chk on">✓</span><span>pr-list.js</span></div>
          <div class="row sel"><span class="chk"></span><span>review-pane.js</span><span class="tag warn">new</span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="chk on">✓</span><span>styles.css</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="app-main" style="gap:12px">
          <div class="diff">
            <div class="hd"><span>review-pane.js · since your last look</span><span>V reviewed</span></div>
            <div>{"   const people = pr.reviewers ?? [];"}</div>
            <div class="del">{"-  row.append(names(people));"}</div>
            <div class="add">{"+  row.append(avatars(people, { max: 3 }));"}</div>
            <div class="add">{"+  if (pr.isDraft) row.append(tag('draft'));"}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="sheet-actions"><span class="small" style="margin-right:auto">CI ✓ · 1 approval</span><span class="btn btn-sm">Request changes <kbd>C</kbd></span><span class="btn btn-sm">Approve <kbd>A</kbd></span><span class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">Merge <kbd style="color:inherit;border-color:currentColor;background:transparent">M</kbd></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
